#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:5 bda269b3c4a84b7f806b4d2721606409
msgid "Vibration Failsafe"
msgstr "震动失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:7 9dca5cc6ac7f4b23b341b7b7597ebaa6
msgid ""
"The vibration failsafe is a little different than most other failsafes in "
"ArduPilot, in that it does not initiate a flight mode change. Instead it "
"changes the algorithm which controls altitude and climb rate in altitude "
"control modes. It is enabled by default, but can be disabled by setting "
":ref:`FS_VIBE_ENABLE<FS_VIBE_ENABLE>` = 0."
msgstr ""
"震动失控保护与 ArduPilot "
"中大多数其他失控保护略有不同，它不会触发飞行模式更改。相反，它会更改在高度控制模式下控制高度和爬升率的算法。它默认启用，但可以通过设置 "
":ref:`FS_VIBE_ENABLE<FS_VIBE_ENABLE>` = 0 来禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:10
#: 99e6fdb9d6af49149b79910527450700
msgid "Impact of High Vibrations"
msgstr "高震动的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:12
#: 745b5962d93c4f9597b5ce635b1d9098
msgid ""
"Multicopters can suffer from very high vibration levels (more than 60m/s/s) "
"which can lead to the accelerometers saturating (i.e. going beyond the range"
" that the sensor can measure). This leads to “clipping” and means the EKF "
"cannot accurately calculate its climb rate or vertical acceleration. This "
"can lead to the vehicle becoming unable to control its climb rate and, in "
"severe situations, can lead to the vehicle climbing rapidly at full "
"throttle."
msgstr ""
"多旋翼飞机可能遭受非常高的震动水平（超过 60m/s/s），这会导致加速度计饱和（即超出传感器可以测量的范围）。这会导致\"截波\"，意味着 EKF "
"无法准确计算其爬升率或垂直加速度。这可能导致飞行器无法控制其爬升率，在严重情况下，可能导致飞行器以全油门快速爬升。"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:15
#: c9d59507efa14a3997c9b5d668fa1596
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护何时触发"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:17
#: 109842a4cafd43c7bfd80387238dd4d5
msgid ""
"The vibration failsafe will trigger if all of the following are true for at "
"least one second:"
msgstr "如果以下所有条件持续至少一秒，震动失控保护将触发："

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:19
#: 93292279b0544a738c5bcc42c4ef087b
msgid ""
"EKF’s vertical velocity innovations are positive (see onboard log's XKF3.IVD"
" value)"
msgstr "EKF 的垂直速度创新值为正（见机载日志的 XKF3.IVD 值）"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:20
#: f42a8b5756ad4ef9ab6a2ac2b310d2a9
msgid "EKF's vertical position innovations are positive (see XKF3.IPD)"
msgstr "EKF 的垂直位置创新值为正（见 XKF3.IPD）"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:21
#: a19355cd8e2943d8903504601e6d167b
msgid "EKF's velocity variance is 1 or higher (see XKF4.SV)"
msgstr "EKF 的速度方差为 1 或更高（见 XKF4.SV）"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:23
#: 2412eb06888f4867a9ab2fea2b6de68d
msgid ""
"An ``Innovation`` is the difference between the predicted value and the "
"latest (non-IMU) value. A ``Variance`` is the EKF’s reported confidence in "
"its estimate. 0 is very good, >1 is bad."
msgstr ""
"``Innovation``（创新）是预测值与最新（非 IMU）值之间的差异。``Variance``（方差）是 EKF 对其估算置信度的报告。0 "
"表示非常好，>1 表示较差。"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:26
#: d48418d409564b32bec72abb8f709bf3
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:28
#: 7729727cdd244e07b6e81a17c1fa6c71
msgid "If the vibration failsafe triggers the following will happen:"
msgstr "如果震动失控保护触发，将发生以下情况："

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:30
#: ae4c3942ed684e169273b4aa6c97244f
msgid ""
"“Vibration compensation ON” will appear on the Ground Stations HUD. EKF’s "
"climb rate will be calculated using a 3rd order complementary filter which "
"is tuned to be more resistant to vibration (but less accurate) than the "
"normal method."
msgstr ""
"Vibration compensation ON\"将出现在地面站的 HUD 上。EKF 的爬升率将使用三阶互补滤波器计算，该滤波器调整为比正常方法更能抵抗震动（但精度较低）。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6158, \"zh\": \"高度控制器切换到更能抵抗震动的两阶控制器（位置->速度），而不是常规的三阶控制器（位置->速度->加速度）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6159, \"zh\": \"飞行器不会更改模式，但其高度保持将比正常情况精度低。飞行器可能会超过其高度目标和/或对飞手输入响应更慢。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6160, \"zh\": \"从失控保护中恢复\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6161, \"zh\": \"EKF 恢复正常后 15 秒，震动失控保护将停用\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6162, \"zh\": \"\"Vibration compensation OFF\"将显示在 HUD 上\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6163, \"zh\": \"高度和爬升率控制器将恢复其正常方法\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6164, \"zh\": \"风向标与抗风悬停\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6165, \"zh\": \"在大风中飞行传统直升机或某些多旋翼飞机可能是一个挑战。问题是任何平板表面，例如传统直升机的尾翼和尾梁，都为风提供了大量的受风面积，这可能导致姿态和位置控制降低以及高电机和 ESC 负载。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6166, \"zh\": \"为了减少在 VTOL 模式下飞行时风的影响，ArduPilot 代码支持主动偏航轴风向标功能，通过保持飞行器迎风飞行并减少暴露在风中的受风面积，可以大大减少风对 VTOL 飞行的影响。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6167, \"zh\": \"主动风向标\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6168, \"zh\": \"主动风向标在 GUIDED 和/或 AUTO 模式下飞行时使飞行器转向迎风。您可以通过将 :ref:`WVANE_ENABLE <WVANE_ENABLE>` 参数设置为非零值并选择在 GUIDED 和/或 AUTO 模式下使用来启用主动风向标。默认不使用主动风向标。\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6169, \"zh\": \":ref:`WVANE_ENABLE<WVANE_ENABLE>` 值\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6170, \"zh\": \"风向标方向\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6171, \"zh\": \"0\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6172, \"zh\": \"禁用\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6173, \"zh\": \"1\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6174, \"zh\": \"机头迎风（默认）\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6175, \"zh\": \"2\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6176, \"zh\": \"机头或机尾迎风\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6177, \"zh\": \"3\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6178, \"zh\": \"侧面迎风\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6179, \"zh\": \"4\"},\n"
" {\"id\": 6180, \"zh\": \"机尾迎风\"}"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:31
#: 5c9955b2649b499c8f29ff6c9700c392
msgid ""
"Altitude controller switches to a more vibration resistant two-stage "
"controller (position->velocity) instead of the regular three-stage "
"controller (i.e. position->velocity->acceleration)"
msgstr "高度控制器切换为更抗震动的两阶段控制器（位置→速度），替代常规的三阶段控制器（即位置→速度→加速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:32
#: 9071431bcc264e9483e0e3d4a427636e
msgid ""
"The vehicle will not change mode but its altitude hold will be less accurate"
" than normal. The vehicle may overshoot it’s altitude targets and/or respond"
" more slowly to pilot input."
msgstr "飞行器不会切换模式，但其定高精度将低于正常水平。飞行器可能会超越目标高度，和/或对飞手输入的响应变慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:35
#: 2fdf04be38ed4837a9b7244d0052a10d
msgid "Recovery from the failsafe"
msgstr "从失控保护中恢复"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:37
#: 058a71350a294ee8bfe4bb213e790be0
msgid ""
"Vibration failsafe will deactivate 15 seconds after the EKF returns to "
"normal"
msgstr "EKF 恢复正常后 15 秒，震动失控保护将自动停用"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:38
#: 1bb115e04f344f6597a52551c80c9142
msgid "“Vibration compensation OFF” will be displayed on the HUD"
msgstr "HUD 上将显示 「Vibration compensation OFF」"

#: ../../source/docs/vibration-failsafe.rst:39
#: 9512242d20eb422b8c4674ef07957aad
msgid ""
"Altitude and climb rate controllers will return to their normal methods"
msgstr "高度和爬升率控制器将恢复正常工作方式"
